  "html": "\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row cols-2\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>竞跑健行<br>\nRun for  Health<br> 5K Run/\n<br>2K Walk<br></h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/%E4%BA%8B%E5%B7%A5%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE/community-run-%E7%A4%BE%E5%8C%BA%E5%81%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%B3%A8%E5%86%8C/\">Registration 报名吧！</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Saturday, Apr 18, 2026\n9:00AM - 1:00PM<br>\n2026-4-18 <br>9:00 5公里跑和家庭亲子活动，11:00 社区聚餐联谊<br><br>Pineville Lake Park <br> 909 Lakeview DR. Pineville, NC 28134<br>-Little Sugar Creek Greenway（跑步）<br>-Large shelter (集合点)</h3>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/%E4%BA%8B%E5%B7%A5%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE/community-run-%E7%A4%BE%E5%8C%BA%E5%81%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%B3%A8%E5%86%8C/\">Registration 报名吧！</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"video\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/a3YUEu-ayOs\" title=\"YouTube video\" loading=\"lazy\" allow=\"accelerometer; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></div>\n\t\t\t\t<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/%E4%BA%8B%E5%B7%A5%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE/community-run-%E7%A4%BE%E5%8C%BA%E5%81%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%B3%A8%E5%86%8C/\">Registration 报名吧！</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"row cols-2\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>健康轻健行</h3>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>参加这个说走就走的健行。让我们为健康付出，暂时放下负担和烦恼，把握生活溅起的美丽浪花，哪怕离明天的幸福还有一小段路。</p><p><span>项目费用 $10/人</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/%E4%BA%8B%E5%B7%A5%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE/community-run-%E7%A4%BE%E5%8C%BA%E5%81%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%B3%A8%E5%86%8C/\">Registration 报名吧！</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>健康先锋行</h3>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>为热衷于运动的您量身打造，<span>健行距离5km。沿途提供水和相关用品。</span><span>有领跑和医疗支持。</span></p><p><span>项目费用 $20/人</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/%E4%BA%8B%E5%B7%A5%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE/community-run-%E7%A4%BE%E5%8C%BA%E5%81%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%B3%A8%E5%86%8C/\">Registration 报名吧！</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"map\"><iframe src=\"https://maps.google.com/maps?q=909%20Lakeview%20Dr%2C%20Pineville%2C%20NC%2028134&amp;t=m&amp;z=16&amp;output=embed&amp;iwloc=near\" title=\"Map\" loading=\"lazy\"></iframe></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row cols-4\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5><a href=\"https://www.pinevillenc.gov/government/departments/parks-recreation/parks-facilities/lake-park/\">Address 地址</a></h5><p> Pineville Lake Park\n<br> - Large Shelter\n<br> 909 Lakeview Dr, Pineville, NC 28134\n</p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5>Email 邮件地址</h5><p>OllieTreeFoundation@gmail.com\nollietree5k@gmail.com</p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5>电话号码</h5>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1><a href=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/%E5%A5%89%E7%8C%AE2/\">募款目标：$10,000</a></h1>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWeb Designer\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2%\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t募款支持\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"row cols-2\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1357\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2022/11/volunteer-3874924_1920.png\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>盛情邀请青少年参加我们的义工<br></h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>如果您有兴趣了解或是支持我们的活动。请致电或发送电子邮件给我们。我们期待您的加入。</p><p><span>我们寻求约</span><span>4小时的现场支持，帮助引导人流，疏通车辆，购买和分配后勤物资。场地搭建和整理。</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>橄榄树基金-美好生活公益健行</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row cols-2\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>橄榄树基金会，是一个以社区建设和社区服务为己任的非盈利组织，我们倡导健康的生活方式，向社区提供专业医生的健康讲座和健康资讯，</p>\n<p>橄榄树基金会健康社区5千米健行，既是为实现健康社区”第一步”做最实际的努力。也是为每年十月金秋的‘<span><a href=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/freeclinic2022/\">橄榄树基金社区健康义诊</a></span>’筹集善款。两个项目相互支持，相得益彰。健行助您不生病，义诊还你得健康。</p>\n<p>从2018年开始每年十月推广免费社区义诊，在美国疫情期间不但坚持科学规范义诊，而且组织了大量紧缺医疗物资从国内免费支持当地社区、养老院。为社区健康提供了有力的支持。</p><p>2023年我们建立了‘橄榄树健康. 慢跑群’ 从基础开始，逐渐培养健康向上的生活方式。<span>千里之行始于足下，健行是健康生活方式最有效的切入点。我们在这里相互帮助，相互鼓励，相互陪伴。团结成一个有活力，有目标，有风格的健康社区。如果您愿意用时间或是资金来支持我们，请和我们联系。橄榄树基金会感谢您的支持和参与。</span></p>\n<p>我们附上从初学者循序渐进的锻炼参考。帮助大家从基础到进阶迈出走向健康生活方式的第一步。</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"720\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2022/11/103e79d6a3596582-photo.jpg\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row cols-2\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"694\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2022/11/3ecfc10f11bbde0b-photo.jpg\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"619\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2022/11/9a0e8543859cbf66-photo.jpg\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row cols-2\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"610\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2022/11/1131e137469a3c06-photo.jpg\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2022/11/d16d7f1db93881dc-photo.jpg\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n"
}